OL,3,GNEWSA'We've waited 73 years to be here'
OL,4,A- Wales fans ecstatic after win over
OL,5,ANew Zealand
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Prince of Wales, who is patron of
OL,8,Fthe Welsh Rugby Union (WRU) also
OL,9,Fcongratulated the team on the win,
OL,10,Fsaying it was a "fantastic result".
